Package: scipR
Title: SCIP Indexer for R Workspaces
Version: 0.9.58
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Santiago",
           family = "Cano-Muniz",
           email = "tisalon@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates SCIP (Source Code Intelligence Protocol) indexes for R
    projects. Definitions and references are resolved across files and
    through S3, S4, S7 and R6 classes, closures, Shiny modules and plumber
    routes, then written as a protobuf index that code search and navigation
    tools can read. Ships a 'scip-r' command line tool.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://phisanti.github.io/scip-R/, https://github.com/phisanti/scip-R
BugReports: https://github.com/phisanti/scip-R/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
